# Arch-specific upstream parts and their Debian adaptation.
# Format: <upstream path> | <status> | <what Armbian does>
# Status: done, todo. A todo entry is not installed yet, or fails on Debian.
# See build/armbian-hyprland-shell/AGENTS.md, rule 3.

etc/sudoers.d/* | done | Group %wheel becomes %sudo (transform 30-sudoers-group).
bin/omarchy-provision-owner | done | The owner gets the group sudo and a %sudo rule (transform 35-owner-group). Other wheel mentions in bin are comments.
Learn > manual and community, update what's new and help | done | docs.armbian.com, the Armbian release notes and the Armbian Discord (transform 95-armbian-links).
Learn > Arch | done | Removed: Armbian is Debian, and Learn > Armbian covers it (maintainer decision, transform 96-learn-no-arch).
pacman outside omarchy-pkg-* (fingerprint setup, remove launcher entry, upload log, debug log) | done | apt and dpkg; logs go to paste.armbian.com (transforms 97-pacman-to-apt, 93-debug-dpkg).
PAM includes (lock screen, fingerprint, FIDO2) | done | Arch system-local-login and system-auth become Debian common-* stacks. The lock screen did not unlock before (transform 98-pam-debian).
etc/sddm.conf.d (theme) | done | armbian-firstlogin writes armbian.conf with Current=breeze. overlay etc/sddm.conf.d/zz-armbian-hyprland-shell.conf sorts last and keeps the Omarchy greeter.
shell/plugins/menu/MenuModel.js (menu package guards) | done | The menu built its package set with pacman, so omarchy-pkg-present was always false. The set comes from dpkg and deps.map (overlay usr/lib/armbian-hyprland-shell/pkg-names, transform 99-menu-guards-dpkg).
etc/NetworkManager/conf.d/omarchy-connectivity.conf, network panel captive portal | done | Debian endpoint network-test.debian.org instead of ping.omacom.io (transform 94-connectivity-debian).
timezone at first login | done | armbian-firstlogin sets it from the public IP, but Wi-Fi laptops are offline then. First-run sets it with tzupdate while it is still UTC (overlay install/user/first-run/armbian-timezone.sh, transform 91-first-run-timezone).
install/config/firewall.sh | done | Runs once at boot (overlay usr/lib/armbian-hyprland-shell/system-setup, armbian-hyprland-shell-setup.service), after allowing SSH 22, which Armbian enables. Kept when the admin already enabled ufw.
install/config/enable-services.sh (docker) | done | Docker starts on first use: docker.socket enabled, docker.service disabled once (system-setup).
localsend command | done | The LocalSend .deb installs localsend_app; Arch installs localsend. Menu, share helper and Nautilus extension call localsend_app (transform 92-localsend-command).
default/wayland-sessions/omarchy.desktop | done | Session name "Armbian (Hyprland uwsm)" (transform 40-session-name).
default/plymouth | done | Not installed: Armbian ships its own Plymouth theme (armbian-plymouth-theme).
install/user/theme.sh | done | New users start with the armbian theme (transform 50-default-theme).
config/chromium-flags.conf | done | The Arch Chromium launcher reads it; the Debian wrapper does not. overlay etc/chromium.d/zz-omarchy-flags adds its flags and merges its extensions into --load-extension.
/usr/share/chromium/extensions/*.json (Claude, 1Password) | done | Debian /etc/chromium.d/extensions loads every entry there as an unpacked extension, and Chromium shows an error dialog. overlay etc/chromium.d/extensions-armbian passes only folders; Chromium reads the .json files itself.
default/applications/mimeapps.list, default/hypr/apps/system.lua | done | Evince becomes Papers, its Debian successor (transform 70-pdf-viewer-papers).
default/omarchy/launcher.hides | done | Also hides im-config: Debian fcitx5 depends on it, and its entry opens nothing (transform 75-launcher-hides-im-config).

omarchy-pkg-* (pacman, yay) | done | apt versions, same names and arguments (overlay usr/share/omarchy/bin). omarchy-pkg-debname translates Arch names with deps.map, installed at /usr/share/armbian-hyprland-shell/deps.map.
omarchy-pkg-aur-* | done | Debian has no AUR: the commands use the Debian and Armbian repositories (overlay).
omarchy-version | done | Version of the armbian-hyprland-shell package (overlay).
omarchy-update-available | done | Reports a new armbian-hyprland-shell in the apt lists (overlay).
omarchy-update-system-pkgs | done | apt-get update and upgrade, changed conffiles kept (overlay).
omarchy-update-keyring, omarchy-update-aur-pkgs | done | No-op: apt keys come from keyring packages; no AUR (overlay).
omarchy-update-pkg-prune, omarchy-update-orphan-pkgs | done | apt-get autoclean and autoremove, same prompts (overlay).
omarchy-update-restart | done | dpkg -S finds the package of a kernel (transform 60-kernel-owner-dpkg).
omarchy-menu-keybindings (lua) | done | Debian keeps lua at 5.1, which has no -E. The key sheet calls lua5.5 (transform 85-keybindings-lua55, deps.map lua).
sbin commands (rfkill, iw, modprobe) | done | Arch merges /usr/sbin into /usr/bin. uwsm adds the sbin folders to the session PATH (overlay usr/share/uwsm/env.d/50-armbian-sbin).
pactl, rfkill, cryptsetup | done | Arch base packages provide them. deps.map maps libpulse, util-linux and cryptsetup to the Debian packages.
superwhisper-bin (dictation) | done | Proprietary: only the vendor channel may distribute it. Install, first run and removal use the official vendor installer in ~/.local (transform 90-superwhisper-vendor-installer). deps.map recommends its dependencies.
default/bashrc | done | bash owns /etc/skel/.bashrc, and dpkg cannot divert a conffile. User setup and omarchy-reinstall-configs copy it over an unchanged Debian ~/.bashrc (overlay install/user/bashrc.sh, transform 45-bashrc-user-step).
omarchy-settings.install (passwordless sudo) | done | Same steps in the maintainer scripts and usr/lib/armbian-hyprland-shell/passwordless-transition (overlay).
/run/lock (sudo-passwordless and Windows VM locks) | done | Arch /run/lock is root 0755, Debian 1777: the lock checks refused it. /run/omarchy from the package tmpfiles (transform 89-protected-lock-dir).
default/libalpm/hooks/05-omarchy-passwordless-revoke.hook | done | Installed: omarchy-sudo-passwordless checks it. The maintainer scripts do its work.
default/libalpm/hooks/10-*, 90-* | done | Hyprland reload pause and resume run from preinst and postinst.
default/libalpm/hooks/00-omarchy-update-guard.hook | todo | Blocks pacman updates outside omarchy-update. apt has no such hook yet.
omarchy-agent-account-add (agent CLIs) | done | Installs the CLIs with mise, as upstream. mise is built in armbian/external. Fixes "Installing the Claude CLI didn't finish".
owe (owed.service, /usr/share/owe hooks) | done | Built in armbian/external (build/owe.yaml). A dependency: first-run fails without it.
default/systemd/user/*.service | done | Installed but not enabled for all users, as upstream: dh_installsystemduser --no-enable. First-run enables them per user.
journal access (Arch group wheel) | done | The group sudo reads the journal (debian/armbian-hyprland-shell.tmpfiles). omarchy-crash-watch needs it.
bt-agent.service | done | bt-agent comes from bluez-tools, a dependency.
default/systemd/zram-generator.conf.d, zram-generator | done | Not installed: armbian-zram-config manages zram swap and the /var/log zram. Both gave two zram swaps (maintainer decision: keep Armbian).
omarchy-power-profiles-daemon | done | Debian power-profiles-daemon. The Omarchy patches add Apple, NVIDIA N1X/GB10 and Snapdragon X support only.
etc-overrides/os-release | done | Not installed: it is Omarchy branding. Armbian keeps its own os-release.

etc/nsswitch.conf, etc/security/faillock.conf | todo | Upstream overwrites base files: compare with Debian, then install as a divert or a drop-in.
etc/sysusers.d | done | Installed. postinst creates the cups-browsed user: the upstream drop-in runs cups-browsed as that user.
etc/cups | todo | cups-browsed.conf and cups-files.conf replace Debian conffiles: compare first.
etc/docker, etc/gnupg | todo | Files that Debian packages or users own: install only where no other package owns them.
etc/plymouth | todo | Upstream plymouthd.conf selects the Omarchy theme: keep the Armbian theme.
etc/mkinitcpio.conf.d, etc/limine-entry-tool.d | todo | Arch boot: adapt to initramfs-tools and GRUB or U-Boot.
default/limine, default/snapper | todo | Snapshots and boot entries: Debian snapper, Armbian boot loaders.
migrations | todo | Migrations that call pacman: check each one. New users start with all migrations done.
pinta, moonlight-qt | done | Built in armbian/external from source (build/pinta.yaml, build/moonlight-qt.yaml).
dotnet-runtime | done | Not needed: Pinta is built self-contained, and the dotnet dev environment installs with mise.
voxtype-bin | done | Upstream .deb, mirrored for amd64 (mirror/voxtype.yaml). arm64: todo, upstream has no .deb.
deps.map source:vendor | todo | qmk-hid, v4l2-relayd: no Debian or Armbian package yet.
omarchy-version-channel, omarchy-version-pkgs (About) | done | About read the pacman mirror list and log. It shows the Armbian repository (stable or rolling) and the last apt upgrade (overlay). The OS line shows the Armbian release (transform 88-about-armbian).
etc/fastfetch/config.jsonc (theme line) | done | echo -e needs bash; Debian /bin/sh is dash. The command runs with bash (transform 88-about-armbian).
Update > Channel (omarchy-channel-current, omarchy-channel-set) | done | Stable is apt.armbian.com, Rolling (the edge entry) is beta.armbian.com. armbian-config switches the repository and its kernel. Armbian has no RC or dev repository: those entries are removed (overlay, transform 87-channel-armbian-repository).
omarchy-refresh-plymouth (Update > Config > Plymouth, Plymouth reset) | done | Upstream publishes its omarchy theme, which Armbian does not ship, and runs mkinitcpio. It sets the armbian theme with plymouth-set-default-theme -R, which runs update-initramfs (overlay).
Install > Gaming > Steam, Lutris (lib32 drivers) | done | Arch multilib becomes Debian i386 multiarch: steam-installer (contrib) and mesa-vulkan-drivers:i386 or nvidia-driver-libs:i386 (deps.map). omarchy-install-gaming-gpu-lib32 enables i386 first. Debian has no arm64 Steam: the entry shows on x86 only (transform 86-steam-debian).
Setup > Security > FIDO2 | done | pamu2fcfg is a separate Debian package that libpam-u2f only recommends; the setup installs it (transform 84-fido2-pamu2fcfg).
wine-mono, wine-gecko | done | WineHQ does not package them: Wine downloads them when a prefix needs them. Both map to winehq-staging (deps.map).
